ODW8115 Translatable term contains variables. Interpolate outside the translation call
 --> translation_contains_variable.py:1:1
  |
1 | _("Hello %s" % name)
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
2 | _("Hello {}".format(name))
3 | _("Hello %s") % name
  |

